    "type": "question",
    "label": "19",
    "prompt": "Belgian cheese costs $\\$1.70$ for $\\frac{1}{2}$ a kilogram. How much will $2\\frac{1}{2}$ kilograms of Belgian cheese cost?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$8.50$",
      "worked": "The number of half-kilogram portions is\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\frac{1}{2}\\div\\frac{1}{2}&=\\frac{5}{2}\\times\\frac{2}{1}\\\\2\\frac{1}{2}\\div\\frac{1}{2}&=5.\\end{align*}$$\nThe cheese costs\n$$\\$1.70\\times5=\\$8.50.$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
